"57-df-theory\">57-df-theory</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"140b30594fbd26d8\" href=\"?note=140b30594fbd26d8\" title=\"57-df-first-order-language\">57-df-first-order-language</a> 的字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq\">\\(\\preceq\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6a7fe4775125052f\" href=\"?note=6a7fe4775125052f\" title=\"57-df-elementary-substructure\">57-df-elementary-substructure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathfrak B|\">\\(|\\mathfrak B|\\)</span> 表示载体，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigl||\\mathfrak B|\\bigr|\">\\(\\bigl||\\mathfrak B|\\bigr|\\)</span> 表示其基数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ls\\text{-}countable}\\vdash\n(|S|\\le\\aleph_0\\land\\mathfrak A\\models T)\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;\n(\\mathfrak B\\preceq\\mathfrak A\\land\\mathfrak B\\models T\\land\\bigl||\\mathfrak B|\\bigr|\\le\\aleph_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ls\\text{-}countable}\\vdash\n(|S|\\le\\aleph_0\\land\\mathfrak A\\models T)\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;\n(\\mathfrak B\\preceq\\mathfrak A\\land\\mathfrak B\\models T\\land\\bigl||\\mathfrak B|\\bigr|\\le\\aleph_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>可数字母表条件保持不变。结论的基数作用于被量化结构的载体，不作用于一个未绑定的 B；有限模型也允许。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"140b30594fbd26d8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-thm-ls-downward","status":"resolved","id":"7e46eab7508a86c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-thm-ls-downward]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"6a7fe4775125052f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-elementary-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"9c053a73bd2d84c4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"140b30594fbd26d8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 为 [[57-df-first-order-language]] 的字母表，$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S$，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$。$\\preceq$ 取 [[57-df-elementary-substructure]]；$|\\mathfrak B|$ 表示载体，$\\bigl||\\mathfrak B|\\bigr|$ 表示其基数，见 [[57-df-structure]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"6a7fe4775125052f","anchor":"ref-8","targetA